OL,3,GNEWSATown to host Nordic Viking-themed
OL,4,AChristmas event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA festive celebration featuring live
OL,7,Fmusic, a Christmas market and a Nordic
OL,8,FViking-themed parade is set to return
OL,9,Fto Grimsby next month.
OL,11,FThe Great Grimsby Christmas Festival
OL,12,Fwill take place in the town centre on
OL,13,F28 November from 12:00 to 19:00 GMT,
OL,14,Fwith the Christmas tree lights being
OL,15,Fswitched on at 17:45.
OL,17,FThe main stage in St James' Square will
OL,18,Fhost live entertainment throughout the
OL,19,Fday, including local musicians, a
OL,20,Fgospel choir and other musical
OL,21,Fperformances.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
