OL,3,GNEWSATown to host Nordic Viking-themed
OL,4,AChristmas event
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth East Lincolnshire councillor Bob
OL,7,FCallison said: "It'll be a day no one
OL,8,Fwants to miss out on with live
OL,9,Fentertainment and plenty of other
OL,10,Fstalls to look at too."
